@display("std/apis")
apis: component(path = "std/apis", lang = "heron") {
  | The [extension point](#language.interop.declaring.extension_point) transports implement, so a new protocol is bound with `js(…)` and needs no new build.
  |
  | Its surface is declared in `std/apis/package.heron`, whose types the API reference renders.
  | `Transport`, `Response` and `transport` are specified in [Transports](#language.apis.transports.transport_binding).

  uses = [language.std.types]
}
